{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene is arranged with a monitor positioned on the top side. To the left of the monitor sits a pair of jeans, and a tie is placed above the jeans. For every remote present in the layout, the remote is smaller than the monitor. To the left of each remote is a watch which is smaller than the remote itself. Furthermore, a fork is positioned above the watch, and a ruler is placed above the fork.",
